{"id":"tordu","lemma":"tordu","pos":"adj","rank":3203,"glosses":["crooked, twisted","twisted, evil, underhand"],"ipa":"/tɔʁ.dy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-tordu.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-tordu.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"tordue","masculinePlural":"tordus","femininePlural":"tordues"},"examples":[{"text":"Il m'a tordu le bras.","en":"He twisted my arm.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"arm"}]},{"text":"Les dents de la fourchette étaient tordues.","en":"The tines of the fork were bent.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"tooth","l":"dent"},null,null,{"g":"fork"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Je me demande pourquoi tant de ces clous sont tordus.","en":"I wonder why so many of these nails are bent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to ask","l":"demander"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"so much"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"nail","l":"clou"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Tom m'a tordu le bras.","en":"Tom twisted my arm.","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"arm"}]},{"text":"Tom a un sens de l'humour tordu.","en":"Tom has a warped sense of humor.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"meaning, sense"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"humor"},null]}]}